Create a single cover image. The only visible text anywhere in the image is exactly: 为什么清洗后的运动鞋不宜直接贴近暖气烘干？. Render it exactly once, with no subtitle or other text, in #1A6B3A, high-contrast Songti-like editorial serif, semibold, left aligned in the continuous white title-safe zone, with at most 2 lines and only readability-driven wrapping. This instruction overrides every non-title sentence elsewhere in the Prompt. The title is the strongest visual element; never place artwork in its safe zone.

Use restrained abstract composition as the cover direction. Build one continuous left-to-right reading movement from the title side toward a right-side resolution. Begin outside the title zone with this low-weight, source-derived entry: 标题左侧保持完整留白，右侧以很轻的灰色湿气痕迹作为进入. Develop the same carrier as: 一只完整的白色手绘运动鞋，鞋舌自然打开，鞋内深处保留少量灰色水汽记号. Resolve it as: 水汽在鞋口外变为稀疏、向上的短小气流记号，鞋身保持干净且未贴近热源. Follow the cover flow and rhythm: one continuous source-derived subject moves from the title side to one right-side resolution quiet entry, measured development, and one resolved focal area.

Keep one source-derived carrier rather than a body diagram, data preview, card wall, or collage. Do not use body diagram; collage; logo reserve content.

Everything in this block is invisible semantic direction, never visible text. Do not render, quote, label, or paraphrase any wording from it: 为什么清洗后的运动鞋不宜直接贴近暖气烘干？. Turn its source-supported promise into the visual: 让鞋内水分有序离开，比让鞋面迅速发烫更有效，也更能保护材料完整性。. The primary carrier is 一只鞋舌打开、鞋口留有通风空间的运动鞋. Make these source requirements visible: 一只完整的运动鞋; 打开的鞋舌与鞋口通风空间; 由鞋内向鞋口外逐渐离开的少量水汽记号; 没有暖气片、热风机或火焰. Do not imply: 高温是必要的干燥条件; 运动鞋可以被直接烘烤; 任何具体品牌的护理承诺.

Scene integrity is non-negotiable: Depict exactly 1 complete embodied subject(s). Continuity rules: 鞋面、鞋舌、鞋底和鞋带必须属于同一只完整运动鞋; 鞋舌只自然打开，不与鞋体分离; 水汽记号只能从鞋口附近离开. Never depict: 分离鞋底; 重复鞋头; 断裂鞋带; 暖气或热风设备..

Do not add labels, leaders, connectors, directional lines, notes, relation words, source excerpts, data, or microcopy. The cover uses no annotation plan and must remain one editorial subject rather than a body diagram.

Apply this direct production style prompt exactly. Follow the page-specific colour direction as an additional constraint:

