Everything in this block is invisible semantic direction, never visible text. Do not render, quote, label, or paraphrase any wording from it: 鞋内水分需要先从纤维、泡棉和夹层迁移到表面，再通过蒸发离开。. The reader block is: 水分必须从鞋内材料移到表面并蒸发到空气中；仅外层干爽不足以证明内部干燥。. Preserve this source relationship: 鞋内纤维、泡棉和夹层中的水分依次迁移到鞋表面，随后蒸发离开。. Make the source relationship legible through this visual solution: 用一只侧向剖开的完整运动鞋表现内部纤维、泡棉与夹层；少量水滴从鞋内依次经过鞋表面，再变为鞋口外稀疏气流，一条细品牌绿方向线只指向这条迁移路径。. Show: 一只完整的侧向剖开运动鞋; 鞋内纤维、泡棉和夹层中的少量水滴; 水滴由内向外移动至鞋表面; 鞋口外由水滴转为稀疏蒸发气流; 从内到外的单向细绿色关系线. Explicitly do not imply: 反馈循环; 高温设备参与迁移; 鞋内已经完全干燥.

Scene integrity is non-negotiable: Depict exactly 1 complete embodied subject(s). Continuity rules: 鞋面、内衬、泡棉中底、鞋舌和鞋底必须构成同一只连续完整的运动鞋; 剖面只揭示鞋侧的内部层次，不能把鞋分成独立碎片; 水滴仅沿鞋内至鞋口外的单向路径出现. Never depict: 分离鞋底; 重复鞋头; 断裂鞋舌; 第二只鞋; 暖气或热风设备..

Use flow as the one dominant visual grammar, never a second grammar. Its required topology is: Make the source-supported ordered steps, state changes, or input-to-output movement legible in one direction; do not imply an ongoing feedback cycle.. It must visibly prove: ordered states or steps; source-supported transition. Generic symbols, anonymous nodes, or arrows alone do not prove the source relationship: every non-self-evident source step or term must be identified by the exact short label or note declared in this page's annotation plan. Do not substitute: loop; timeline without real time; parallel concept map.

Make this selected grammar visibly provable in the finished image through these reader-visible facts: 水滴在鞋内、鞋表面与鞋口外依次改变位置与状态; 一条单向路径清楚地从内部材料通向空气，不回到鞋内. Each proof must be visible in the content stage itself, not supplied only by the title or subtitle. Do not let one generic illustrative scene substitute for this evidence.

Apply only this page's declared information encoding:
- label targets 鞋内剖面中的水滴; render exactly "鞋内水分"; source support: 鞋内水分需要先从纤维、泡棉和夹层迁移到表面
- label targets 鞋口外的稀疏气流; render exactly "表面蒸发"; source support: 再通过蒸发离开
- directional_line targets 从鞋内水滴到鞋口外气流的单向关系; render no text; source support: 先从纤维、泡棉和夹层迁移到表面，再通过蒸发离开
Its visual language is: Use quiet thin gray leaders and labels; one declared green relation line may be used. Render only the exact visible label or note content declared by the page plan. Annotations are subordinate to the relationship and never decorative. Do not add any annotation not declared here.

Create a single explanatory body image. Render exactly once in the pure-white upper title region: 水分要先走出鞋内. Use the core-title role: high-contrast Songti-like editorial serif, semibold, #1A6B3A, at most 1 line, center aligned around the title-region center at x=600; never left or right align it. Render exactly once directly below it: 外干，不等于内干. Use the subtitle role: regular, #6B6B6B, at most 1 line, center aligned around that same center; never left or right align it. Treat the two lines as one centered text block. Keep this title region free of artwork, frame, and divider.

Keep all semantic elements inside one small, delicate content cluster with 60–72% quiet space, no more than 3 semantic groups, and 0–2 supporting elements. The drawn cluster occupies at most 56% of the content-stage width and 58% of its height. Use a small_to_medium hero scale: do not enlarge the central object merely to make its relationship legible; do not let it fill the lower half or reach the stage edges. Keep any declared labels and explanations local and subordinate. Split the page instead of adding competing structures when the relationship cannot remain legible. Do not use edge-to-edge hero; oversized object or dashboard; card wall; unrelated scenery; logo reserve content.

