Everything in this block is invisible semantic direction, never visible text. Do not render, quote, label, or paraphrase any wording from it: 贴近暖气或热风出口时，受热侧与背阴侧会形成明显温差。织物、合成革、EVA 等泡棉材料、橡胶和胶黏层会以不同速度升温和形变。. The reader block is: 直接热源使受热侧与背阴侧产生温差，因此不同材料不会以同一速度升温和形变。. Preserve this source relationship: 同一双鞋的靠近热源侧与背阴侧处于不同温度状态，多个材料层对此产生不同响应。. Make the source relationship legible through this visual solution: 用两只结构相同的白色侧向运动鞋并列对照：左侧鞋被一个抽象热源近距离影响并呈现近侧热线，右侧鞋置于无热源的稳定空气中；鞋面、泡棉与胶黏边缘在两种状态下保持可见的不同位置或轮廓。. Show: 直接热源附近的一只完整鞋; 无直接热源的另一只完整鞋; 两只鞋的受热侧与背阴侧结构差异; 热源侧与背阴侧的可见温差. Explicitly do not imply: 具体温度数值; 任何品牌材料的确定耐热阈值; 热风可以安全替代通风.

Scene integrity is non-negotiable: Depict exactly 2 complete embodied subject(s). Continuity rules: 每一只鞋都必须有连续鞋面、鞋舌、鞋底和鞋带; 左鞋和右鞋不得互相拼接或共享鞋底; 热源只能作为左鞋外侧的抽象非主体符号. Never depict: 分离鞋底; 重复鞋头; 断裂鞋带; 人物; 品牌标识..

Use comparison as the one dominant visual grammar, never a second grammar. Its required topology is: Make two or more source-supported alternatives visibly different even when labels are hidden; at least one difference must be object, position, connection, sequence, or boundary.. It must visibly prove: two or more alternatives; visible structural difference. Generic symbols, anonymous nodes, or arrows alone do not prove the source relationship: every non-self-evident source step or term must be identified by the exact short label or note declared in this page's annotation plan. Do not substitute: single-process diagram; name-only comparison; generic chart.

Make this selected grammar visibly provable in the finished image through these reader-visible facts: 两只鞋的热源距离不同; 直接受热鞋的两侧状态不对称，另一只鞋保持均衡. Each proof must be visible in the content stage itself, not supplied only by the title or subtitle. Do not let one generic illustrative scene substitute for this evidence.

Make these source-supported comparison differences visibly distinct in objects, positions, connections, sequence, or boundaries: 左侧鞋的一侧紧邻抽象热源，另一侧未受直接加热; 右侧鞋没有直接热源且整体轮廓保持均衡; 左侧鞋的鞋面、泡棉与胶黏边缘在靠热侧出现不均匀响应.

